      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add onto this, I also run into this issue. Usually after 30 minutes of world-hopping, I am suddenly unable to click on a world's thumbnail in the large world menu. The client just makes the clicking sound and nothing happens. This has happened perhaps 4 times \"in a row\" for me, meaning that it happens every time I've visited multiple worlds in a row in a single vrchat session. Clearing the cache does not fix the issue. \n\nI am adding onto this thread because, after restarting the client, open the client, see the auto-login happen successfully, and then am just left in the initial world-loading world, with my home world not even loading.\n\nSomething unique did happen this most recent time, though, which might help find a solution. I somehow clicked on a world's thumbnail in-game and was able to open it in the large menu, but then was unable to create an instance, with the error \"Invalid Admin Credentials\" being thrown.\n\nWhat does that error mean? When I'm using the client successfully for a while, visiting worlds, and then suddenly I have \"invalid admin credentials\" from out of nowhere. What could cause this?\n\nThank you for your assistance!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
